With some advanced preparation, you learn to create and equip one of a number of useful tools (at level [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)]):

Grappling Hook:

Throw a grappling hook up to range [4, 5, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] that drags you towards the target or the target towards you. 8 turn cooldown.

Rogue's Brew:

Prepare a potion that restores [220, 273, 319, 361, 400 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] life, [54, 68, 79, 90, 99 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] stamina, and cures [1, 1, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)] negative physical effects. 20 turn cooldown.

Dart Launcher:

Fire a poisoned dart dealing [67, 82, 94, 104, 112 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] physical damage that puts the target to sleep for 4 turns. 10 turn cooldown.

Smokescreen:

Throw a smokebomb creating a radius 2 cloud of smoke, lasting [3, 4, 5, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns, that blocks sight and reduces enemies' vision by [1, 2, 3, 4, 6 (TL1-5)]. 15 turn cooldown.

Hidden Blades:

Melee criticals trigger an extra unarmed attack, inflicting [135%, 150%, 161%, 171%, 180% (TL1-5)] damage. 4 turn cooldown.

Preparing a tool sets its talent level and puts it on cooldown.
